Hi,

The Tracing Summit schedule is now available online at
http://tracingsummit.org/wiki/TracingSummit2015

Don't forget to register by using the following link:

https://www.regonline.com/register/checkin.aspx?EventId=1696291&MethodId=0&EventSessionId=&startnewreg=1

Unlike previous years, there is no need to register to any other event
to attend. However, a 60$ registration fee is required for attendees.

This year, the tracing summit is held in Seattle, WA, USA, on August 20th,
2015, at the Sheraton Seattle. This event is co-located with LinuxCon
North America 2015.

Looking forward to see you in Seattle!

